<div class="episode"><b>05</b> NBA TIME MACHINE / AN ORIGINAL INVESTIGATION</div>
<h1 id="article-title">We tried to find the <em>next Moses Malone.</em></h1>
<p class="dek">The model picked Karl-Anthony Towns. But if the point of Moses Malone was to own every missed shot, is the closest statistical match really the closest basketball match?</p>
